@startuml
title 3.5.2 Collect eligible matching examples
caption UC-101 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: Proposed entity; no migration
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "System" as Actor
participant "Proposed Dataset Collector" as Page
participant "Proposed Training Service" as Service
participant "matching_training_examples" as Table <<proposed entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Collect reviewed matching examples
activate Page
Page -> Service: 2: Run task with current eligible context
activate Service
Service -> Service: 3: Resolve approved privacy policy and reviewed outcome sources
Service -> Table: 4: Proposed: collect eligible, deduplicated example metadata
activate Table
Table --> Service: 5: Candidate dataset entries
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 6: Reject unreviewed outcomes and sensitive/private evidence
Service -> Service: 7: Record provenance and quality review; require anonymization
Service --> Page: 8: Reviewed example candidates
Page --> Actor: 9: Record task outcome
deactivate Service
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: Proposed design only: no active collection workflow or migration for this entity. User
matching feedback is not an approved training dataset.
endlegend
@enduml
